18. {'MESH:D006425': {'cui': 'MESH:D006425', 'name': 'Hemic and Lymphatic Diseases', 'types': 'Disease', 'aliases': 'Blood and Lymphatic System Disorders', 'definition': 'Hematologic diseases and diseases of the lymphatic system collectively. Hemic diseases include disorders involving the formed elements (e.g., ERYTHROCYTE AGGREGATION, INTRAVASCULAR) and chemical components (e.g., BLOOD PROTEIN DISORDERS); lymphatic diseases include disorders relating to lymph, lymph nodes, and lymphocytes.'}

